{"id":"0cef01d05fea81a2","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-itokobayashi.md","title":"Discrete Stochastic Exponential (legacy label)","display":"df-itokobayashi — Discrete Stochastic Exponential (legacy label)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-itokobayashi","aliases":["58-df-itokobayashi","Ito-Kobayashi"],"display":"df-itokobayashi — Discrete Stochastic Exponential (legacy label)","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-itokobayashi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-itokobayashi</span><span>Ito-Kobayashi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-itokobayashi — Discrete Stochastic Exponential (legacy label)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbc48f9241507d2e\" href=\"?note=fbc48f9241507d2e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation\">58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Q,E,\\Omega\\in V\">\\(X,Q,E,\\Omega\\in V\\)</span> (discrete process, its quadratic variation, exponential process, and sample space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)\\)</span> (discrete quadratic variation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fbc48f9241507d2e\" href=\"?note=fbc48f9241507d2e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation\">58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^\\Omega)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochasticExponential}_S(E;X,Q,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{StochasticExponential}_S(E;X,Q,\\Omega)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}itokobayashi}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StochasticExponential}_S(E;X,Q,\\Omega)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(X(0)(x)=0\\land E(0)(x)=1\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n-1&lt;X(n+1)(x)-X(n)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land E(n+1)(x)=E(n)(x)\n\\bigl(1+X(n+1)(x)-X(n)(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}itokobayashi}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StochasticExponential}_S(E;X,Q,\\Omega)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(X(0)(x)=0\\land E(0)(x)=1\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n-1&lt;X(n+1)(x)-X(n)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land E(n+1)(x)=E(n)(x)\n\\bigl(1+X(n+1)(x)-X(n)(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the discrete Doléans stochastic exponential.  The increment bound makes every multiplicative factor positive; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> remains in the legacy four-place interface only to certify the supplied quadratic-variation companion.</li>\n<li>The continuous-local-martingale identity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(X)_t=\\exp(X_t-\\tfrac12[X]_t)\">\\(\\mathcal E(X)_t=\\exp(X_t-\\tfrac12[X]_t)\\)</span> is not valid for a general discrete process and is therefore not used here.</li>\n<li>Novikov: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\frac{1}{2}\\langle M \\rangle_T) &lt; \\infty \\implies \\mathcal{E}(M)\">\\(\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\frac{1}{2}\\langle M \\rangle_T) &lt; \\infty \\implies \\mathcal{E}(M)\\)</span> martingale</li>\n<li>Quotient: Girsanov uses exponential martingale to change measure; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\tilde{B}_t = dB_t + \\theta_t dt\">\\(d\\tilde{B}_t = dB_t + \\theta_t dt\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Revuz and Yor, Continuous Martingales and Brownian Motion</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation","status":"resolved","id":"fbc48f9241507d2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation","status":"resolved","id":"fbc48f9241507d2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)$ (discrete quadratic variation, see [[58-df-zfc-prob4-quadratic-variation]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{>0}^\\Omega)$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Q,E,\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{>0}^\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StochasticExponential}_S(E;X,Q,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}itokobayashi}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StochasticExponential}_S(E;X,Q,\\Omega)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4QuadraticVariation}_S(X,Q,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{>0}^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(X(0)(x)=0\\land E(0)(x)=1\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n-1<X(n+1)(x)-X(n)(x)\\\\\n&\\hspace{31mm}\\land E(n+1)(x)=E(n)(x)\n\\bigl(1+X(n+1)(x)-X(n)(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(X)_t=\\exp(X_t-\\tfrac12[X]_t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\frac{1}{2}\\langle M \\rangle_T) < \\infty \\implies \\mathcal{E}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\tilde{B}_t = dB_t + \\theta_t dt","display":false}],"bytes":1947,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-713","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-itokobayashi.md|58-df-itokobayashi]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["fbc48f9241507d2e","36d7463d215be751"]}